WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.248
Bird and Kip were at the circus.

2
00:00:13.249 --> 00:00:17.006
"What a great show!" said Bird.

3
00:00:17.007 --> 00:00:19.690
"It sure is," said Kip.

4
00:00:19.691 --> 00:00:22.441
"I wish I could be in the circus!"

5
00:00:22.442 --> 00:00:26.679
Acrobats flew through the air.

6
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:30.432
"That's amazing," said Bird.

7
00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:36.717
"I wish I could do that!" said Kip.

8
00:00:36.718 --> 00:00:42.190
"Wow!" said Bird. "Look at that!"

9
00:00:42.191 --> 00:00:49.299
A tightrope walker walked above the crowd.

10
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:55.541
"I wish I could do that!" said Kip.

11
00:00:55.542 --> 00:01:04.475
A tiny little car drove into the ring.

12
00:01:04.476 --> 00:01:07.029
A clown got out of the car.

13
00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:09.940
The clown smiled and waved.

14
00:01:09.941 --> 00:01:12.727
Then another clown got out.

15
00:01:12.728 --> 00:01:16.742
And then more clowns got out.

16
00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:20.545
"That's a lot of clowns!" said Bird.

17
00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:28.863
The clowns all ran around in circles.

18
00:01:28.864 --> 00:01:31.152
They threw pies at each other.

19
00:01:31.153 --> 00:01:34.764
They bumped into each other and fell down.

20
00:01:34.765 --> 00:01:36.954
Everybody laughed.

21
00:01:36.955 --> 00:01:39.415
"Well, Kip," said Bird.

22
00:01:39.416 --> 00:01:45.410
"You could definitely do that!"

